From: Vahiru <nekovahiru@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] codec2: map gralloc-backed linear blocks on devices without
 ION

"codec2: add support for custom mappers" makes C2LinearBlock::map() and
C2ConstLinearBlock::map() go through mapWriteView() and mapReadView(),
which hand every block to C2DmaBufAllocator::Map() when ION is not in
use. C2DmaBufAllocator::Map() rejects handles that are not C2HandleBuf
with C2_BAD_VALUE. When the preferred linear allocator is BLOB
(gralloc-backed), as debug.stagefright.c2-poolmask selects on the Huawei
MateBook E Go, the v4l2 decoder cannot map a client's input block, the
codec-specific data of HEVC streams cannot be merged into the first
frame (patches/android/v4l2-codec2/0005) and no frame is decoded.

Use allocation->map() as before for handles that are not DMABUF. DMABUF
handles keep the custom mapper path.

Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 media/codec2/vndk/C2Buffer.cpp | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Buffer.cpp b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Buffer.cpp
index b22119f..854baaf 100644
--- a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Buffer.cpp
+++ b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Buffer.cpp
@@ -1253,7 +1253,10 @@ C2Acquirable<C2ReadView> _C2Block1DImpl::mapReadView(
     void *base = nullptr;
     c2_status_t error = C2_OK;
     C2MemoryUsage usage{C2MemoryUsage::CPU_READ, 0};
-    if (android::C2HandleIon::IsUsed()) {
+    // BLOB (gralloc-backed) linear blocks are not DMABUF handles, and
+    // C2DmaBufAllocator::Map rejects them with C2_BAD_VALUE on devices without ION.
+    if (android::C2HandleIon::IsUsed() ||
+            !android::C2DmaBufAllocator::CheckHandle(mAllocation->handle())) {
         error = mAllocation->map(
                 offset, len, usage, nullptr, &base);
     } else {
@@ -1282,7 +1285,10 @@ C2Acquirable<C2WriteView> _C2Block1DImpl::mapWriteView(
     void *base = nullptr;
     c2_status_t error = C2_OK;
     C2MemoryUsage usage{C2MemoryUsage::CPU_READ, C2MemoryUsage::CPU_WRITE};
-    if (android::C2HandleIon::IsUsed()) {
+    // BLOB (gralloc-backed) linear blocks are not DMABUF handles, and
+    // C2DmaBufAllocator::Map rejects them with C2_BAD_VALUE on devices without ION.
+    if (android::C2HandleIon::IsUsed() ||
+            !android::C2DmaBufAllocator::CheckHandle(mAllocation->handle())) {
         error = mAllocation->map(
                 offset, len, usage, nullptr, &base);
     } else {
